{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Taoyuan Village to heal your loneliness. Here, you can lead a carefree, self-sufficient life: farm, tame animals, raise livestock, fish, and build a prosperous homestead. Or, immerse in village life, meet kindred spirits, find love, and influence their destinies with your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/212e9cc63eee49565b87434aa9363352.avif?t=1761121224\" width=616 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/171060ee3b6c96cfd491d43c5d90f96b.webp?t=1761121224\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's the labor you put in or the relationships you cultivate, every drop of sweat you shed will bear fruit. In Taoyuan Village, no effort goes unrewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/6c595313360ae3a0d7549c3ad5730624.poster.avif?t=1761121224\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/6c595313360ae3a0d7549c3ad5730624.webm?t=1761121224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/6c595313360ae3a0d7549c3ad5730624.mp4?t=1761121224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/d4782655cc1c444f30beca5acde0905a.webp?t=1761121224\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are nine major occupations: farming, forestry, animal husbandry, fishing, tailoring, cooking, construction, mining, or martial arts. Which one do you want to excel in?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/8a31b4a93d5593d01ecede1ea9a6261f.poster.avif?t=1761121224\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/8a31b4a93d5593d01ecede1ea9a6261f.webm?t=1761121224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/8a31b4a93d5593d01ecede1ea9a6261f.mp4?t=1761121224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/f8d98ac9a6ca84d12a77ac4b42a543fd.webp?t=1761121224\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your house, furnish it with decorations, and create your ideal countryside compound.\u00a0&quot;Where the heart finds peace is home.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/73e6e239e11034e431c5cec8ec5ef052.poster.avif?t=1761121224\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/73e6e239e11034e431c5cec8ec5ef052.webm?t=1761121224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/73e6e239e11034e431c5cec8ec5ef052.mp4?t=1761121224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/7f4900cc41af04d98898999b50c93539.webp?t=1761121224\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend wild creatures\u2014train them as assistants or keep them as companions.\u00a0The world may be frayed, but little paws mend it stitch by stitch.\u00a0(And yes, those with hooves or wings count too!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/17324abf88989f9c54d726df835f845e.poster.avif?t=1761121224\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/17324abf88989f9c54d726df835f845e.webm?t=1761121224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/17324abf88989f9c54d726df835f845e.mp4?t=1761121224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/dc0fc2f75c8d0eeb4461f2caa937efbe.webp?t=1761121224\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The villagers may be few, but each has a past, a story, and their own flaws and virtues\u2014just like real people. Treat them with sincerity, and their attitudes toward you will change. You might even alter the course of their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/d437f4bf4e8fa2463570770fbb083b4c.poster.avif?t=1761121224\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/d437f4bf4e8fa2463570770fbb083b4c.webm?t=1761121224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/d437f4bf4e8fa2463570770fbb083b4c.mp4?t=1761121224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/91f0bfd0678637ac511d2492dd3a8d0d.webp?t=1761121224\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience vibrant festivals\u2014Spring Festival, Qingming, Dragon Boat, Qixi, Mid-Autumn, Chongyang\u2014along with grand Chinese-style weddings and bustling rural fairs. Immerse yourself in the most traditional Chinese flavor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/063656b1b86056cf9027286cf473f2cc.poster.avif?t=1761121224\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/063656b1b86056cf9027286cf473f2cc.webm?t=1761121224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/extras/063656b1b86056cf9027286cf473f2cc.mp4?t=1761121224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2678830?t=1761121224","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761121224","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/5d7b67cf2e1d9240832ae83429915e045fa5bd9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761121224","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678830/5d7b67cf2e1d9240832ae83429915e045fa5bd9b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761121224","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{